<title>JAPAN: TDK shares up on healthy rise in group profit.</title>
<headline>TDK shares up on healthy rise in group profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in TDK Corp surged on Wednesday morning on the healthy rise in the firm's group profit for the half year to September 30, which was announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 230 yen to 7,010 yen at 0102 GMT, closing in on the year's high of 7,060 yen set on October 15.  </p>
<p>TDK's group sales in the six months to September 30 reached 301.7 billion yen, up from 255.3 billion yen in the same period a year earlier, while group net profit was 34.4 billion yen, up from 9.7 billion.</p>
</text>
